  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.24-dev.12-alpha2\n\n- ext: spell the \"skip unless a real directory\" test as an if, shellcheck failed the release on it\n- kiosk: the queue scrolls under a finger, and a shared Lyrion no longer hands us someone else's player\n- ext: third-party packages install, and their maintainer scripts finally run\n- deps: close the 28 open Dependabot alerts in both lockfiles\n- image: every word that ships on the device, in English\n- site: count visits by network, not by user-agent alone\n- fix(sito): ripristina la registrazione delle visite (segnaposto di troppo)\n- fix(sito): conferma browser anche dagli header, non solo dalle immagini\n- fix(sito): riconoscimento bot pi\u00f9 severo e rete di provenienza\n- fix(sito): il crawler di Facebook non conta pi\u00f9 come visitatore\n",
